cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the Mouse harness in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Mouse harness"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: McGrath
    given-names: Pete
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-07
repository-code: "https://github.com/mousedev/mouse-harness"
url: "https://www.mouse.dev"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Mouse runs OpenCode in a repository and does not stop until the repository's
  own checks pass. A deterministic completion loop probes the workspace after
  every turn, runs the detected or declared checks, scans for deleted
  verification files, and requires a structured self-audit before a run is
  considered satisfied.
keywords:
  - coding-agent
  - harness
  - opencode
  - benchmark
